Description: Advanced network policy management for embedded Linux
 Network Policy provides comprehensive network management for embedded
 systems with multiple interfaces (Ethernet, WiFi, LTE, WireGuard).
 .
 Features include:
  * Integrated stateful firewall with nftables
  * Health monitoring with automatic failover
  * Policy-based routing with per-interface tables
  * Runtime-reloadable TOML configuration
  * NetworkManager profile management
  * DNS failover following default route
  * System settings and user management
